WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
This walkthrough uses the new START HERE screen. Pause whenever
you need. No code is required.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:17.137
Use Minecraft Java Edition 26.2, Fabric Loader, the matching
Fabric API mod, and Java 25. The written guide

00:00:17.137 --> 00:00:25.000
links the official Fabric instructions. Use the Fabric setup for
your own launcher.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.772
Open gonuts.at and choose Download for Minecraft 26.2. Save the
GoNuts jar without extracting it. Normal

00:00:34.772 --> 00:00:39.000
keyless setup does not need a manual API key.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.171
Close Minecraft. Open the game folder for the installation you
actually launch. Put GoNuts and the matching

00:00:48.171 --> 00:00:56.914
Fabric API jar in its mods folder. Create mods if missing. Keep
only one GoNuts jar. Updating does not

00:00:56.914 --> 00:01:00.000
require deleting your configuration.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:08.921
Launch your Fabric installation and join DonutSMP. Enable the
sidebar scoreboard in the server settings so

00:01:08.921 --> 00:01:17.000
GoNuts can read your balance. Press B. Check Minecraft Controls
if you changed that key binding.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:26.000
A new install opens START HERE. If you see another tab, click
the gold START HERE button at the beginning of

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:35.000
navigation. Then click the large gold Set up trading button.
Missing that button means your client needs the

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.000
newer build.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.855
Enter maximum per trade and maximum session spend. Choose your
own amounts; these screenshot values are

00:01:44.855 --> 00:01:53.796
examples, not recommendations. Swarm is optional. Review and
continue opens the second step. It does not

00:01:53.796 --> 00:01:55.000
start trading.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:03.442
Review protections opens Evasion. Read its options and review
Staff Watch separately if you use it. Return

00:02:03.442 --> 00:02:11.805
to setup afterward. Swarm linking and Discord are optional
connections. Opening a guide does not start or

00:02:11.805 --> 00:02:13.000
resume trading.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:23.286
On Review and Start, check your limits and readiness. This
offline demonstration has not joined a server, so

00:02:23.286 --> 00:02:33.381
Start is disabled. On your client, read the actual blocker.
Choose Start trading only when ready. Existing

00:02:33.381 --> 00:02:37.000
recovery and trade checks still apply.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:46.085
For trading status and controls, press B, choose START HERE,
then Open Trade. Trade is the current name for

00:02:46.085 --> 00:02:55.000
AutoPilot. Use the displayed reason if a session is paused or
blocked. End is the default emergency stop.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:02.769
If you hid the game menus or hotbar, open START HERE and click
Show menus plus hotbar. Only those two

00:03:02.769 --> 00:03:10.923
display options change for this account. Your name privacy and
trading settings stay intact. Use the video

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:14.000
or More tutorials whenever you get lost.
